    {
      "subId": "7210807",
      "subQuestName": "Report back to Ioroi",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721080901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721080901": {
            "id": "721080901",
            "speakerId": 3159,
            "speakerName": "Ioroi",
            "text": "Hehe, well done! They seem to be quite happy.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721080902"
            ]
          },
          "721080902": {
            "id": "721080902",
            "speakerId": 3159,
            "speakerName": "Ioroi",
            "text": "...Huh? Oh, no problem. Let me ask them for you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721080903"
            ]
          },
          "721080903": {
            "id": "721080903",
            "speakerId": 3159,
            "speakerName": "Ioroi",
            "text": "Gyoubu Koban was asking, \"If you are humans, why do you smell like tanuki?\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721080904"
            ]
          },
          "721080904": {
            "id": "721080904",
            "speakerId": 3159,
            "speakerName": "Ioroi",
            "text": "...Actually, that's right! I demand an explanation! Why *do* you smell like tanuki?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721080905"
            ]
          },
          "721080905": {
            "id": "721080905",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Eh? You're only asking this now...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721080908"
            ]
          },
          "721080908": {
            "id": "721080908",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Right! That's what happened!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721080909"
            ]
          },
          "721080909": {
            "id": "721080909",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Miss Masked Maiden cooked us a very lavish meal earlier, and she said that she used magic she secretly learned from the bake-danuki to make it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721080910"
            ]
          },
          "721080910": {
            "id": "721080910",
            "speakerId": 3159,
            "speakerName": "Ioroi",
            "text": "What? She learned our magic in secret? How dare she...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721080911"
            ]
          },
          "721080911": {
            "id": "721080911",
            "speakerId": 3159,
            "speakerName": "Ioroi",
            "text": "Hmm... Could it be...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721080912"
            ]
          },
          "721080912": {
            "id": "721080912",
            "speakerId": 3159,
            "speakerName": "Ioroi",
            "text": "Oh, come on. That sneaky kitsune! If she was still alive, she could at least have come over to say hello, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721080913"
            ]
          },
          "721080913": {
            "id": "721080913",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "She's a shrine maiden with a mask, and she called you an \"old friend.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721080914"
            ]
          },
          "721080914": {
            "id": "721080914",
            "speakerId": 3159,
            "speakerName": "Ioroi",
            "text": "Mask? I don't know anyone with a mask. Don't know any shrine maidens, either. I sure do know a kitsune, though.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721080915"
            ]
          },
          "721080915": {
            "id": "721080915",
            "speakerId": 3159,
            "speakerName": "Ioroi",
            "text": "...That said, that sneaky kitsune did appear in the form of a shrine maiden before. What does the shrine maiden you speak of look like?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721080916"
            ]
          },
          "721080916": {
            "id": "721080916",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "She wears a white fox mask...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721080917"
            ]
          },
          "721080917": {
            "id": "721080917",
            "speakerId": 3159,
            "speakerName": "Ioroi",
            "text": "Anything else?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7210815",
      "subQuestName": "Report back to Ioroi",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721080931"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721080931": {
            "id": "721080931",
            "speakerId": 3159,
            "speakerName": "Ioroi",
            "text": "What? I didn't realize that it was so important. You should've said so earlier...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721080932"
            ]
          },
          "721080932": {
            "id": "721080932",
            "speakerId": 3159,
            "speakerName": "Ioroi",
            "text": "Agh, I was sealed over this thing for...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721080936"
            ]
          },
          "721080936": {
            "id": "721080936",
            "speakerId": 3159,
            "speakerName": "Ioroi",
            "text": "Ugh! Stop speaking so lightly of my misfortunes!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721080937"
            ]
          },
          "721080937": {
            "id": "721080937",
            "speakerId": 3159,
            "speakerName": "Ioroi",
            "text": "Never mind. It's all water under the bridge now. I do also have some inkling about the barrier near the forest.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721080938"
            ]
          },
          "721080938": {
            "id": "721080938",
            "speakerId": 3159,
            "speakerName": "Ioroi",
            "text": "Back when I was fighting that sneaky kitsune, I once saw it on the eastern seashore. It looks like a Thunder Sakura with a torii gate, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721080939"
            ]
          },
          "721080939": {
            "id": "721080939",
            "speakerId": 3159,
            "speakerName": "Ioroi",
            "text": "Back when that guy was battling the demons or whatever, I was worried that some of them might come out to hurt us. So I used magic to put a seal on that place.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721080940"
            ]
          },
          "721080940": {
            "id": "721080940",
            "speakerId": 3159,
            "speakerName": "Ioroi",
            "text": "Let me see. The seal should be under the cliff face to the east... Kichiboushi, take them there and remove the seal.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721080941"
            ]
          },
          "721080941": {
            "id": "721080941",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Thank you, Ioroi.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721080942"
            ]
          },
          "721080942": {
            "id": "721080942",
            "speakerId": 3159,
            "speakerName": "Ioroi",
            "text": "Alright, alright. Enough jibber-jabber. Go now.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721080943"
            ]
          },
          "721080943": {
            "id": "721080943",
            "speakerId": 3159,
            "speakerName": "Ioroi",
            "text": "If you run into that sneaky kitsune, remember to send her my regards. Just say... let me think...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721080944"
            ]
          },
          "721080944": {
            "id": "721080944",
            "speakerId": 3159,
            "speakerName": "Ioroi",
            "text": "\"You've ticked me off real good this time, you jerk. Come back and fight me — our contest isn't over yet! And help me break this seal while you're at it, would you? It's not as if I couldn't do it myself or anything, but you still owe me a favor! Also, Gyoubu Koban says he misses you!\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721080945"
            ]
          },
          "721080945": {
            "id": "721080945",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Whoa, whoa, that's a lot to remember!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7210808",
      "subQuestName": "Head to the location of the barrier",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721080801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721080801": {
            "id": "721080801",
            "speakerId": 3159,
            "speakerName": "Ioroi",
            "text": "Ooh... I do so wish to scratch mine belly...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721080802"
            ]
          },
          "721080802": {
            "id": "721080802",
            "speakerId": 3159,
            "speakerName": "Ioroi",
            "text": "Mm? You're back already? Go on, help me find Shousei, Gyoubu Koban, and Kichiboushi, and go <color=#00E1FFFF>play with them.</color>",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721080803"
            ]
          },
          "721080803": {
            "id": "721080803",
            "speakerId": 3159,
            "speakerName": "Ioroi",
            "text": "Alright then, off you go."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7210809",
      "subQuestName": "Wait for Kichiboushi",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721081101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721081101": {
            "id": "721081101",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "This is it? It's just a bunch of bare stones...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721081102"
            ]
          },
          "721081102": {
            "id": "721081102",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmm? He seems to be using some kind of magic to...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721081103"
            ]
          },
          "721081103": {
            "id": "721081103",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Whoa! The stones disappeared!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721081106"
            ]
          },
          "721081106": {
            "id": "721081106",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So this is bake-danuki magic? Seems kinda fun!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721081107"
            ]
          },
          "721081107": {
            "id": "721081107",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Thank you, Kichiboushi! Let's play Hide-and-Seek next time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721081108"
            ]
          },
          "721081108": {
            "id": "721081108",
            "speakerId": 3160,
            "speakerName": "\"Kichiboushi\"",
            "text": "Mm!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7210817",
      "subQuestName": "Destroy the barrier",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7210820",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721082001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721082001": {
            "id": "721082001",
            "speakerId": 20221,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "That was well done — whether it was dealing with Ioroi's illusory tricks, or the way you defeated those demons.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721082002"
            ]
          },
          "721082002": {
            "id": "721082002",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "\"Eek!\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721082003"
            ]
          },
          "721082003": {
            "id": "721082003",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Or so Paimon might have said, but this trick of yours is getting real old, Miss Masked Maiden.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721082004"
            ]
          },
          "721082004": {
            "id": "721082004",
            "speakerId": 20221,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "Ah, so I disappointed you, then? I apologize. I'll do better next time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721082005"
            ]
          },
          "721082005": {
            "id": "721082005",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "There's no need to \"do better\" at trivial things like this...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721082006"
            ]
          },
          "721082006": {
            "id": "721082006",
            "speakerId": 20221,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "That is true. So, as for Ioroi... Is he doing well?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721082008",
              "721082010"
            ]
          },
          "721082008": {
            "id": "721082008",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Even though he's been turned into stone.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721082011"
            ]
          },
          "721082011": {
            "id": "721082011",
            "speakerId": 20221,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "I see...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721082012"
            ]
          },
          "721082012": {
            "id": "721082012",
            "speakerId": 20221,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "Usually, when bake-danuki make a mess, we won't send anyone to deal with them as long as they don't cross the line. After all, although they are mischievous, they're kind-hearted and simple, just like children.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721082013"
            ]
          },
          "721082013": {
            "id": "721082013",
            "speakerId": 20221,
            "speakerName": "Hanachirusato",
            "text": "But when Ioroi dared to steal the ward for the Cleansing Ritual, well, that was enough to get him punished. Since the \"Yougou Three\" were mentioned in your story, then it was probably Kamuna... an onmyouji from a past age, who did the deed."
          },
          "721082010": {
            "id": "721082010",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But he's very well!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
